{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04253","headline":"早发诸暨 · 骆宾王","name":"早发诸暨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"征夫怀远路，夙驾上危峦。\n薄烟横绝巘，轻冻澁回湍。\n野雾连空暗，山风入曙寒。\n帝城临灞涘，禹穴枕江干。\n橘性行应化，蓬心去不安。\n独掩穷途泪，长歌行路难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}